  <body
    style="
      background-color: black;
      font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
      padding: 0px 20px;
    "
  >
    <div style="margin: 40px auto; width: 620px">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
        <img
          style="height: 100px"
          src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/logo.svg"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        style="margin-top: 20px"
        class="image-container"
        id="imageContainer"
        style="text-align: center"
      >
        <img
          style="width: 100%; transform: scale(1.1); border-radius: 20px"
          src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/banner4.jpg"
          alt="Banner"
          id="hoverImage"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <div>
          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
              text-align: justify;
            "
          >
            Dear <%= firstname %>,
          </p>

          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
              text-align: justify;
            "
          >
            Welcome to <span style="color: #d4af37">Gamepitara</span>! We're
            delighted to have you join our community of gaming enthusiasts.
          </p>
          <h3 style="color: #aaa7a7">
            Your account login credentials as follows:
          </h3>
          <div style="color: white; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 30px">
            <p style="padding: 3px 0px; letter-spacing: 0.7px">
              <strong>Username:</strong> <%= username %>
            </p>
            <p style="padding: 3px 0px; letter-spacing: 0.7px">
              <strong>Password:</strong> <%= password %>
            </p>
            <p style="padding: 3px 0px; letter-spacing: 0.7px">
              <strong>Email:</strong> <%= email %>
            </p>
          </div>

          <p
            style="
              text-align: justify;
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Thank you for registering with us. As a valued member, you now have
            access to a wide variety of exciting games, exclusive promotions,
            and the chance to win big!
          </p>

          <h3 style="color: #d4af37">Getting Started</h3>

          <div
            style="
              margin-top: 30px;
              height: 30%;
              background: white;
              border-radius: 20px;
              padding: 20px 20px;
              background-image: url('https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/bgimg.png');
              background-repeat: no-repeat;
              background-position: center;
            "
          >
            <div>
              <p style="color: black; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700">
                To kick off your journey, here are a few steps to help you get
                started:
              </p>

              <ul style="padding: 20px; text-align: justify">
                <li style="padding: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400">
                  <strong>Explore Our Games:</strong> Browse our extensive
                  collection of slots, table games, and live dealer games. We
                  have something for everyone!
                </li>
                <li style="padding: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400">
                  <strong style="color: #000000; font-weight: 700"
                    >Claim Your Welcome Bonus:</strong
                  >
                  Don’t forget to take advantage of our generous welcome bonus.
                </li>
                <li style="padding: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400">
                  <strong>Make a Deposit:</strong> Our secure and easy-to-use
                  payment methods ensure that your deposits and withdrawals are
                  processed quickly and safely.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 style="color: #d4af37; margin-top: 30px">Need Help?</h3>
          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Our dedicated support team is here to assist you 24/7. If you have
            any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact
            us at
            <a style="color: #d4af37" href="https://gamepitara.com/"
              >support@[website-name].com</a
            >
          </p>

          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            We're committed to providing you with a safe, enjoyable, and
            rewarding gaming experience. Thank you for choosing
            <span style="color: #d4af37">Gamepitara</span>. We look forward to
            seeing you at the tables!
          </p>

          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Best regards,
          </p>
          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            The <span style="color: #d4af37">Gamepitara</span> Team
          </p>

          <p
            style="
              line-height: 1.5;
              margin: 20px auto;
              color: #c1bdbd;
              font-size: 15px;
              font-weight: 400;
              text-align: justify;
            "
          >
            Stay up-to-date with our latest promotions, tournaments, and special
            events. Follow us on and visit our Social Media given below:
          </p>

          <div
            style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center"
          >
            <div
              style="
                text-align: center;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                background: #fff;
                border-radius: 10px;
                width: 100%;
              "
            >
              <div style="padding: 6px 20px 0px 6px">
                <a href="https://facebook.com"
                  ><img
                    style="
                      width: 20px;
                      height: 20px;
                      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
                    "
                    src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/facebook.png"
                    alt="Facebook"
                /></a>
              </div>
              <div style="padding: 6px 20px 0px 0px">
                <a href="https://twitter.com"
                  ><img
                    style="
                      width: 20px;
                      height: 20px;
                      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
                    "
                    src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/twitter.png"
                    alt="Twitter"
                /></a>
              </div>
              <div style="padding: 6px 20px 0px 0px">
                <a href="https://youtube.com"
                  ><img
                    style="width: 20px; height: 20px"
                    src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/youtube.png"
                    alt="YouTube"
                /></a>
              </div>

              <div style="padding: 6px 20px 0px 0px">
                <a href="https://instagram.com"
                  ><img
                    style="
                      transform: scale(1.2);
                      width: 20px;
                      height: 20px;
                      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
                    "
                    src="https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/instagram.png"
                    alt="Instagram"
                /></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- <hr style="color: white; width: 100%" /> -->

          <div
            style="
              text-align: center;
              padding: 20px;
              font-size: 12px;
              color: white;
            "
          >
            <p>
              &copy; 2024 <span style="color: #d4af37">Gamepitara</span>. All
              rights reserved. |
              <a
                style="color: #4a90e2; text-decoration: none"
                href="https://gamepitara.com/privacy"
                >Privacy Policy</a
              >
              |
              <a
                style="color: #4a90e2; text-decoration: none"
                href="https://gamepitara.com/terms"
                >Terms of Service</a
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script>
      const image = document.getElementById("hoverImage");

      image.addEventListener("mouseover", function () {
        image.src = "https://api.skyoneworld.com/Template/Images/banner4.jpg";
        image.style.transform = "scale(1.1)"; // Example transform effect
        image.style.boxShadow = "0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)"; // Example shadow effect
        image.style.transition = "all 0.3s ease-in-out"; // Smooth transition
      });

      image.addEventListener("mouseout", function () {
        image.style.transform = "scale(1)"; // Revert to original scale
        image.style.boxShadow = "none"; // Remove shadow
        image.style.transition = "all 0.3s ease-in-out"; // Smooth transition
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
